  {
    "source": "Home.jsx",
    "text": "Yes! All our products come with a verified manufacturer warranty, and we provide a lifetime installation guarantee on our wiring work.",
    "type": "content"
  },
  {
    "source": "Home.jsx",
    "text": "Will installing accessories affect my car",
    "type": "content"
  },
  {
    "source": "Home.jsx",
    "text": "We use coupler-to-coupler installation methods which do not cut any original wires, ensuring your car",
    "type": "content"
  },
  {
    "source": "Home.jsx",
